(7097665, 1080809, 147314, '<td valign="top">Lovely image of that wood and croc. I think I would have cropped it a bit more (get lost of the left tree and part of the river), giving more focus on the croc. But I still like it!</td>', 'Lovely image of that wood and croc. I think I would have cropped it a bit more (get lost of the left tree and part of the river), giving more focus on the croc. But I still like it!', '2013-09-03 17:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097666, 1081473, 147314, '<td valign="top">Et tu, mon cher Watson! Great portrait.</td>', 'Et tu, mon cher Watson! Great portrait.', '2013-09-03 17:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097668, 1080783, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great image, nice processing. I especially like the flowers. The background is both nice and distracting.</td>', 'Great image, nice processing. I especially like the flowers. The background is both nice and distracting.', '2013-09-03 17:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097669, 1079139, 147314, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the movement.</td>', 'Love the colours and the movement.', '2013-09-03 17:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097670, 1081618, 147314, '<td valign="top">I think is is a geat image with that boat and the swan on the foreground, colours are nice as well, but the processing killed it for me, especially the transition sky/trees, looks very messy.</td>', 'I think is is a geat image with that boat and the swan on the foreground, colours are nice as well, but the processing killed it for me, especially the transition sky/trees, looks very messy.', '2013-09-03 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097671, 1079528, 147314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girls, lovely image.</td>', 'Beautiful girls, lovely image.', '2013-09-03 17:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097673, 1080707, 147314, '<td valign="top">I like sport images and I know it is quite hard to get that one great shot. This one is really nice, but it is just too much water for me, a bit more of the people in the raft would be nice.</td>', 'I like sport images and I know it is quite hard to get that one great shot. This one is really nice, but it is just too much water for me, a bit more of the people in the raft would be nice.', '2013-09-03 17:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097674, 1079790, 147314, '<td valign="top">I love the light in this image, but it is just too much of a snapshot, with only one person looking at the camera.</td>', 'I love the light in this image, but it is just too much of a snapshot, with only one person looking at the camera.', '2013-09-03 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097676, 1081460, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great image of the bird of prey (osprey?), but it seems like it is a small part of a larger image that is magnified too far.</td>', 'Great image of the bird of prey (osprey?), but it seems like it is a small part of a larger image that is magnified too far.', '2013-09-03 17:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097683, 1079179, 147470, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, made more beautiful by the Dire Straits reference (hopefully it was intentional). They had an album and song called <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Communiqu%C3%A9_(Dire_Straits_album)" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Communiqué</a>, but this shot is a dead ringer for the cover of their live album <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/On_the_night" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">On The Night</a> which ironically doesn''t feature the song Communiqué.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, made more beautiful by the Dire Straits reference (hopefully it was intentional). They had an album and song called Communiqué, but this shot is a dead ringer for the cover of their live album On The Night which ironically doesn''t feature the song Communiqué.', '2013-09-03 17:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097719, 1081669, 38162, '<td valign="top">ironically I love the geometric and dislike the "subject" - guess its just me but whatever is under the bottle adds to distraction.  why not a monotone?</td>', 'ironically I love the geometric and dislike the "subject" - guess its just me but whatever is under the bottle adds to distraction.  why not a monotone?', '2013-09-03 19:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
