(7097887, 1080035, 117534, '<td valign="top">love the pof and light! OR the POV and the light... roflmao... Hummm actually I was right the first time, POF.. Point of Fishermen...</td>', 'love the pof and light! OR the POV and the light... roflmao... Hummm actually I was right the first time, POF.. Point of Fishermen...', '2013-09-03 23:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7097889, 1080031, 147470, '<td valign="top">The more I look at it, the more I like it. I like all the different faces looking in different directions, especially the girl on the advertisement to the right. In fact, she does a good job competing with your main subject for my attention. If I could change one aspect, it would be to get rid of the big fellow in the black shorts and t-shirt. All of that solid black carries a lot of visual weight, and the fact that he''s walking away from the camera makes him even more of a distraction. Might have been more effective with a smaller person walking towards the camera, if you had the opportunity to weight.</td>', 'The more I look at it, the more I like it. I like all the different faces looking in different directions, especially the girl on the advertisement to the right. In fact, she does a good job competing with your main subject for my attention. If I could change one aspect, it would be to get rid of the big fellow in the black shorts and t-shirt. All of that solid black carries a lot of visual weight, and the fact that he''s walking away from the camera makes him even more of a distraction. Might have been more effective with a smaller person walking towards the camera, if you had the opportunity to weight.', '2013-09-03 23:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
