(7099574, 1081476, 108580, '<td valign="top">Classic DPC favourite style in FS. This has a slight twist and that is the subtle mist caught in the rocks at the edge of the water. Very nice.</td>', 'Classic DPC favourite style in FS. This has a slight twist and that is the subtle mist caught in the rocks at the edge of the water. Very nice.', '2013-09-06 17:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
