(7099840, 1080994, 75618, '<td valign="top">Probably not the first mention it but you need to clean your sensor. Sensor dusts all over, esp on the sky.</td>', 'Probably not the first mention it but you need to clean your sensor. Sensor dusts all over, esp on the sky.', '2013-09-07 07:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
