(7099845, 1081594, 56502, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the light on him is too bright compared to the background.</td>', 'In my opinion the light on him is too bright compared to the background.', '2013-09-07 07:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7099859, 1078822, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great lighting and detail on this portrait shot. O.K. does the title "Who, me?" a play on Who Am I? that is being asked to the audience? If so, he bears a striking resemblance to Josh Hutcherson.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great lighting and detail on this portrait shot. O.K. does the title "Who, me?" a play on Who Am I? that is being asked to the audience? If so, he bears a striking resemblance to Josh Hutcherson.', '2013-09-07 10:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7099860, 1081644, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the color and the light which helps project a soft and delicate mood - perfect pairing with the dainty butterfly and flower. And what lovely and gorgeous details you have captured with the butterfly stopping to take a sip from the flower. Well done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the color and the light which helps project a soft and delicate mood - perfect pairing with the dainty butterfly and flower. And what lovely and gorgeous details you have captured with the butterfly stopping to take a sip from the flower. Well done.', '2013-09-07 10:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7099861, 1081537, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great B&amp;W tones on this photo of the hyena. Love the catchlights in the eyes and great details seen on the fur coat - even the muzzle and his nose are in sharp detail. Nicely captured.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great B&W tones on this photo of the hyena. Love the catchlights in the eyes and great details seen on the fur coat - even the muzzle and his nose are in sharp detail. Nicely captured.', '2013-09-07 10:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7099863, 1080644, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great action shot of this horse race! Love the details and the action where the mud is being splashed up as the horses thunder across the wet ''track''. I like the long view but wonder if a closer to the action shot would perhaps be even better. My eye is naturally drawn to the three horses on the left leading the charge - a closer view would show even greater detail on the horses, riders, and the spray of mud being kicked up.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great action shot of this horse race! Love the details and the action where the mud is being splashed up as the horses thunder across the wet ''track''. I like the long view but wonder if a closer to the action shot would perhaps be even better. My eye is naturally drawn to the three horses on the left leading the charge - a closer view would show even greater detail on the horses, riders, and the spray of mud being kicked up.', '2013-09-07 10:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7099864, 1080439, 100393, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1051747" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/100393/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1051747.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Awarded for the August 2013 Free Study, for the reasons identified below. <br/> <br/>This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: <br/> <br/>1. It took me ages to work this image out - she looks so authentically placed.<br/> <br/>2. The juxtaposition of each of the subjects - the gender of the main onlooker is so important to the power of the image.<br/> <br/>3. The rich coloration of the nude image, the light on (of) the face.<br/> <br/>4. The reflected line across the nudes eyes, reminiscent of early attempts to anonymise nude images in slightly racy publications.<br/> <br/>5. The reflected tree, like a veil being dropped to shield her modesty.<br/> <br/>6. The complete absence of you - the other viewers don''t see you - transfixed by her bold beauty.<br/> <br/>Overall. Magnificent.</td>', '  Awarded for the August 2013 Free Study, for the reasons identified below.  This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:  1. It took me ages to work this image out - she looks so authentically placed. 2. The juxtaposition of each of the subjects - the gender of the main onlooker is so important to the power of the image. 3. The rich coloration of the nude image, the light on (of) the face. 4. The reflected line across the nudes eyes, reminiscent of early attempts to anonymise nude images in slightly racy publications. 5. The reflected tree, like a veil being dropped to shield her modesty. 6. The complete absence of you - the other viewers don''t see you - transfixed by her bold beauty. Overall. Magnificent.', '2013-09-07 10:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7099865, 1081562, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (bumped from 9 to 10 with the comment) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Such point-of-viewness! Transportative in its power.<br/> <br/>2. Perfect, perfect tones.<br/> <br/>3. The slight lack of clarity adds to a most artistic, almost dreamlike, presentation.<br/> <br/>4. The pseudo-lobulation of the tree and its reflection on the left.<br/> <br/>5. The intersection of the paddle with the cross strut echoing refractive distortion, thus resonating with the watery vista.<br/> <br/>6. The sense of purpose, the keen vector of the bow.<br/> <br/>7. The misty distant horizon.<br/> <br/>Lovely stuff.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (bumped from 9 to 10 with the comment)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 10s - I like it very much. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Such point-of-viewness! Transportative in its power. 2. Perfect, perfect tones. 3. The slight lack of clarity adds to a most artistic, almost dreamlike, presentation. 4. The pseudo-lobulation of the tree and its reflection on the left. 5. The intersection of the paddle with the cross strut echoing refractive distortion, thus resonating with the watery vista. 6. The sense of purpose, the keen vector of the bow. 7. The misty distant horizon. Lovely stuff.', '2013-09-07 11:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7099866, 1080882, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the deep rich blues that capture the magic and mood of nighttime. Love the starry sky above with some shooting stars that add to the scene.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the deep rich blues that capture the magic and mood of nighttime. Love the starry sky above with some shooting stars that add to the scene.', '2013-09-07 11:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
