(7099877, 1078916, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>At a loss at why the title is relates to being/or going to be punished for wrongdoing when this doggie is getting much attention and reward of ice cream. What a much loved (and spoiled:-) ) pooch:-) They do love ice cream do they not:-) They sit and power beg with big soulful eyes....speaking of eyes, would have loved to have seen the eyes on the dog. I think it would add visual interest and more expression in this pet and their people portrait:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. At a loss at why the title is relates to being/or going to be punished for wrongdoing when this doggie is getting much attention and reward of ice cream. What a much loved (and spoiled:-) ) pooch:-) They do love ice cream do they not:-) They sit and power beg with big soulful eyes....speaking of eyes, would have loved to have seen the eyes on the dog. I think it would add visual interest and more expression in this pet and their people portrait:-)', '2013-09-07 11:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
