(7099879, 1081697, 100393, '<td valign="top">This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier) <br/> <br/>Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more. <br/> <br/>This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me:<br/> <br/>1. Bold. Feels thoughtful. I know that you knew this would get hammered. I like that you believed in it.<br/> <br/>2. The low contrast works for me - it pushes me out of the scene, I can see but can''t be seen - the effect is one of making the viewer a ghost.<br/> <br/>3. The every-day casualness of the scene, adding oodles of authenticity.<br/> <br/>Overall, purposefully understated in a way that brings its own effectiveness.</td>', 'This image has caused me to stop and pay attention. That means it is in my 7-10 voting band. (Voted earlier)  Additionally, it is highly interesting/eclectic meaning it keeps me here long enough to offer a longer comment and a vote of 8 or more.  This is one of my 8s - I like it. Furthermore I think it enriches the DPC collective portfolio. Put simply, I wish we saw more stuff like this. Let me tell you why it pushes all the right buttons for me: 1. Bold. Feels thoughtful. I know that you knew this would get hammered. I like that you believed in it. 2. The low contrast works for me - it pushes me out of the scene, I can see but can''t be seen - the effect is one of making the viewer a ghost. 3. The every-day casualness of the scene, adding oodles of authenticity. Overall, purposefully understated in a way that brings its own effectiveness.', '2013-09-07 11:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
