(7100148, 1081397, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fabulous portrait of Early Man the Cave Dweller. Lighting is fantastic and I have to say the model is very daring to step into this role for the camera:-). Kudos for showcasing something different. I like the expression and the pose - makes me think that he stepped outside the cave to investigate a strange noise ''outside his door''.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fabulous portrait of Early Man the Cave Dweller. Lighting is fantastic and I have to say the model is very daring to step into this role for the camera:-). Kudos for showcasing something different. I like the expression and the pose - makes me think that he stepped outside the cave to investigate a strange noise ''outside his door''.', '2013-09-07 22:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
