(7100421, 1080473, 108580, '<td valign="top">Enjoyed it enough to give it a 7. Expansive and dramatic but perhaps not as crisp as you would have liked for DPC?</td>', 'Enjoyed it enough to give it a 7. Expansive and dramatic but perhaps not as crisp as you would have liked for DPC?', '2013-09-08 05:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
