(7100449, 1080999, 108580, '<td valign="top">WD Lev. 8.<br/>This type of work is giving me more and more courage to try the same on my African travels. I am a very shy "street" photographer who prefers a 500mm paparazzi style and complete isolation when shooting. I love candids. Always have. Again the unobtrusive, versatile and superb OM-D EM5. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=61234" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">wildiris</a> has a winner this month with it too, albeit a macro.</td>', 'WD Lev. 8.This type of work is giving me more and more courage to try the same on my African travels. I am a very shy "street" photographer who prefers a 500mm paparazzi style and complete isolation when shooting. I love candids. Always have. Again the unobtrusive, versatile and superb OM-D EM5.  wildiris has a winner this month with it too, albeit a macro.', '2013-09-08 06:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7100450, 1081629, 108580, '<td valign="top">WD on your ribbon. Sheep are starting to become quite famous at DPC.<br/>Another top ten entry with no 1''s, 2''s, 3''s or 4''s. Quite a feat. See if you can find the other one...</td>', 'WD on your ribbon. Sheep are starting to become quite famous at DPC.Another top ten entry with no 1''s, 2''s, 3''s or 4''s. Quite a feat. See if you can find the other one...', '2013-09-08 06:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
